{"4359800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Panic Together", "steam_appid": 4359800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/25b9373040f739d4bbf13548de742c18.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON’T PANIC TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your voice. Protect your sanity. Survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t Panic Together</strong> is an online co-op psychological horror experience featuring a light bodycam camera aesthetic. Players take on the role of police officers trying to survive and complete their assigned tasks in Grimwood, an abandoned town hidden deep within the forest. But the greatest threat in Grimwood is not only what hides in the darkness — it is your fear, your panic, and your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/201b5f1ee6747d67623e9133ed88088f.poster.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/201b5f1ee6747d67623e9133ed88088f.webm?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/201b5f1ee6747d67623e9133ed88088f.mp4?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a police unit, you are sent to Grimwood to investigate strange incidents and collect important items related to the case. However, as the night progresses, everything begins to change. You can no longer trust what you see, and the only way to survive is to stay quiet and make it through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the microphone detection system, panic can become your downfall. Sudden noises, screaming, or losing control of your voice can directly lead to your death. Because something in Grimwood may be listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/889d125f5b5291ed4e3e2111a1ab3ecc.poster.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/889d125f5b5291ed4e3e2111a1ab3ecc.webm?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/889d125f5b5291ed4e3e2111a1ab3ecc.mp4?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Co-Op (1–4 Players)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your friends or face the darkness of Grimwood alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microphone Detection Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your real voice affects the game. Screaming, panicking, or making sudden noises can have deadly consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is different. Events, threats, and encounters are dynamically generated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bodycam Camera Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic and disturbing perspective with subtle VHS effects and handheld camera movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Atmosphere Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed ambient sounds, sudden effects, and dark visual tones create constant tension throughout the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/ad04aca168ce2c86b307b543f8b7f395.poster.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/ad04aca168ce2c86b307b543f8b7f395.webm?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/ad04aca168ce2c86b307b543f8b7f395.mp4?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the night in Grimwood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your assigned tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect important investigation items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay together with your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet. Something might hear you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Don’t Panic Together?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t Panic Together</strong> turns the player’s real-life reactions into part of the gameplay experience. Fear is not limited to the screen — it spreads into the room around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The calmer you stay, the higher your chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/8e13b74579fbab86e8ed3b07fc2d49c5.poster.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/8e13b74579fbab86e8ed3b07fc2d49c5.webm?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/8e13b74579fbab86e8ed3b07fc2d49c5.mp4?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\