ething in Grimwood may be listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/889d125f5b5291ed4e3e2111a1ab3ecc.poster.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/889d125f5b5291ed4e3e2111a1ab3ecc.webm?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/889d125f5b5291ed4e3e2111a1ab3ecc.mp4?t=1787694420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Co-Op (1–4 Players)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your friends or face the darkness of Grimwood alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microphone Detection Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your real voice affects the game. Screaming, panicking, or making sudden noises can have deadly consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is different. Events, threats, and encounters are dynamically generated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bodycam Camera Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic and disturbing perspective with subtle VHS effects and handheld camera movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Atmosphere Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed ambient sounds, sudden effects, and dark visual tones create constant tension throughout the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/ad04aca168ce2c86b307b543f8b7f395.poster.avif?t=1787694420\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359800/extras/ad04aca